ース/6艇の情報を閲覧。外部通信、保存、投票、架空の予想なし\n- `tests/test_mobile_web_shell.py`: Coming soon、通信遮断、HTML安全性、日時・出典、JS構文の静的テスト\n- `docs/BOAT_FIRST_RELEASE_PLAN.md`: 開発・公開の完全分離と公開前検証条件\n\n## 重要：本番リリース禁止\nこれは最初の**表示用プレビュー（モバイルシェル）**であり、確率予想・買い目・当日オッズ・実レース精度検証は未完了。ユーザーに予想機能が完成済みと表示しない。ソースの利用許諾が未確認の間は無断自動配信しない。\n\n## 依存関係・レビュー\n親PR #8がDraftのため、このPRもDraftでそのブランチに向ける。mainへ直接マージしない。CI成功と独立したコードレビュー、スマホでの実機表示、データ取得権利の検証を要する。PreviewとProductionの別環境を設定するまではデプロイしない。","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-13T22:18:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T00:07:07Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9f69f5bc69bc8cd91efa5f1ae01d9d09cfbffe4b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"haji84:feat/boat-first-mobile-release-shell","ref":"feat/boat-first-mobile-release-shell","repo":{"id":1416489937,"node_id":"R_kgDOVG3r0Q","name":"RACE-AI","full_name":"haji84/RACE-AI","owner":{"login":"haji84","id":173585154,"node_id":"U_kgDOClizAg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173585154?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/haji84","html_url":"https://github.com/haji84","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haji84/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haji84/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haji84/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haji84/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haji84/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haji84/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haji84/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haji84/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haji84/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":"https://race-ai-preview.vercel.app","language":"P